<title>USA: Empire Capital to lease plane to Baikal.</title>
<headline>Empire Capital to lease plane to Baikal.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHPORT, Conn. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire Capital Corp said it has received a letter of intent and the required deposit from Baikal Airlines of Russia to lease a used Boeing 757-200ER commercial passenger jet aircraft valued at $38 million.</p>
<p>Empire is involved in the purchase, sale, lease and financing of used commercial jet aircraft through a wholly owned unit.</p>
<p>The company said it is unable to provide further details on the deal right now due to a confidentiality agreement with Baikal Airlines.</p>
</text>
